      "final": "1. `docs/retry.md`\n```md\n# retry budget\nretry budget means maxAttempts. README mentions retryRequest but does not call it.\nGhostTransportV9 is a documentation-only compatibility label.\n```\n\n2. `src/retry.ts`\n```ts\nexport function retryRequest(task: () => boolean, maxAttempts: number): boolean {\n  // retry budget: bounded attempts on failure\n  for (let attempt = 0; attempt < maxAttempts; attempt++) {\n    if (task()) return true;\n```"
